<title>UK: RBS Participacoes sets $125 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>RBS Participacoes sets $125 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RBS PARTICIPACOES SA</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    01.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   L26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  ONE	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+429 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    DENOMS (K)  **</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND =</p>
<p> NOTES    **100K (144A), 10K (REGS). ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		GUARANTEED BY RELEFISAO GAUCHA, RBS TV, ZERO HORA</p>
<p>		AND RADIO GAUCHA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
